sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as DAP Client
    participant Proxy as dapz Proxy
    participant Server as DAP Server

    Agent->>Proxy: request (command=stackTrace)
    Proxy->>Server: forward
    Server-->>Proxy: response (command=stackTrace)
    Note over Proxy: StackTraceCompressor<br/>path abbreviations<br/>param trimming
    Proxy-->>Agent: response (compressed)
